## Purpose

Record instructions, decisions, corrections and outcomes so future sessions can
resume without inventing progress or approval.

## Tasks

- [x] Record planning and photo acquisition as the initial authorized scope.
- [x] Record public Instagram failure and the owner-export alternative.
- [x] Record screenshot inputs and the minimal-edit requirement.
- [x] Correct the rejected flat checklist to the user's numbered TODO convention.
- [x] Save the TODO structure and schema as cross-repository user memories.
- [x] Record explicit authorization to implement without questions until a prototype is ready.
- [ ] Update this ledger and the workstream files at meaningful milestones.
- [ ] Keep agent evidence, direct inspection and user approval distinguishable.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] A new session can find the current scope, artifacts, blockers and remaining tasks.
- [x] Local implementation is distinguished from public deployment and recovered-account media.
- [ ] Historical entries remain accurate when later work supersedes them.

